    midout wide: phase 3b reads each probe's digits once for four chunks
    
    Each lane covers chunks q, q + 4, q + 8 and q + 12 of one list entry
    (64 probe streams, 64 entries x 16 chunks per cube step). The words,
    masks and records per (entry, chunk) are computed by the same formula
    as before; the records' order in a slab changes. A step places at most
    256 records, one slab.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

